From e3635d080f3fc7b828d36ca9a037a194612cee91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenThesis Build <openthesis@localhost>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 03:08:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6]  vmm: add DST ctrl socket, HLT handler, restore-in-place,
 PMC reporting

Patches 0007-0018 combined:
- DST control socket (burst-start, set-time, advance-quantum, flush-dpq, etc.)
- HLT handler with virtual clock advance + consecutive HLT counter
- VcpuEvent::RestoreState for in-place CPU restore
- Vmm::restore_in_place() with memory reset + CPU + device state
- MmioTransport::restore_state_in_place() for queue index reset
- PMC active flag reported in ping response
- CLI args: --openthesis-dst-ctrl, --openthesis-dst-seed
- RDTSC exiting stub (requires kernel patch)
